T-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 신청기간 :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>2010. 2. 23(화) ～ 2. 25(목) </strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">조기졸업신청서 및 성적증명서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 제출장소 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">해당 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 조기졸업 요건</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">조기졸업을 신청한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 6학기이상 등록하여 소정의 전과정을 이수한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(건축학전공은 8학기이상 등록하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp